OL,3,GNEWSAPoliticians call for resolution to
OL,4,ADrumcree dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FPoliticians have cautioned against
OL,7,Fescalating the parading dispute in
OL,8,FDrumcree, after a warning from
OL,9,Fresidents that it could lead to issues
OL,10,Fwith other marches.
OL,12,FIt's the twelfth day of deadlock
OL,13,Fbetween residents of the Garvaghy Road
OL,14,Fand the local district lodge of the
OL,15,FOrange Order over the proposed march in
OL,16,FPortadown, County Antrim.
OL,18,FOn Wednesday, the Garvaghy Road
OL,19,FResidents Coalition (GRRC) said the
OL,20,Fdisagreement was "no longer just about
OL,21,Fthe Garvaghy Road" after meeting 11
OL,22,Fother nationalist residents' groups.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
